<li>The Moon Is a Harsh Mistress (novel) - Federasi bangsa-bangsa luar angkasa menggunakan "FNS", kemungkinan berarti "Kapal Federasi Bangsa-bangsa" (Federated Nations Ship).</li>
<li>Alien (serial film) - Beberapa pesawat luar angkasa menggunakan awalan "USCSS" (United States Cargo SpaceShip) di serial Nostromo, Prometheus, dan Covenant.</li>
